<section class="page-hero"><span class="pub-kicker">Connections</span><h1>Your business, connected.</h1><p>Bring the systems you already use into StockChief. Connect your own accounts, choose how updates work, and review actions that need your approval.</p></section>
<div class="pub-integration-directory"><% for(const group of groups){ %><section aria-labelledby="group-<%= group.title.toLowerCase() %>"><header><h2 id="group-<%= group.title.toLowerCase() %>"><%= group.title %></h2><p><%= group.description %></p></header><div class="pub-integration-cards"><% for(const p of group.providers){ %><article><div class="pub-integration-logo"><% if(p.logo){ %><img src="/provider-logos/<%= p.logo %>.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"><% }else{ %><span aria-hidden="true"><%= p.name.slice(0,1) %></span><% } %></div><h3><%= p.name %></h3><p><%= p.description %></p><a href="/settings/connections">Set up <%= p.name %> →</a></article><% } %></div></section><% } %></div>
<section class="qualification-note"><h2>Your accounts. Your control.</h2><p>Available actions depend on your plan, provider permissions and account setup. Connect a test account to verify a workflow before enabling automatic work. A listed integration does not mean every provider feature has been certified.</p><a href="/support">Get help with a connection →</a></section>